Required pages
- Home Page
- Product Page
- Checkout Page
- Confirmation Page


Optional Pages
- Category Pages
- Terms and Conditions page
- Privacy Policy page
- My Profile


User Stories
- View a list of products on the homepage
- Filter products by category, gender og genre
- View Single product page with more detail
- Add product to my basket
- Remove product from my basket
- Summary of my cart on the checkout page
- View an order-confirmation screen after checking out


Process
- Use API to get data information
(One of theese: 
    Rainy Days API - Outdoor clothing - https://docs.noroff.dev/docs/v2/e-commerce/rainy-days 
    --> GameHub API - Video games - https://docs.noroff.dev/docs/v2/e-commerce/gamehub 
    Square Eyes API – Movies - https://docs.noroff.dev/docs/v2/e-commerce/square-eyes 
)
- Create a working website (MVC was allowed according to a teacher)
- Simple and clean CSS
- DRY in both JS and CSS
- Use the information from Moodle 




MVC
UpdateView()
  - Main hub for viewing the content
Function for each page: 
  - HomePageView()
  - ProductPageView()
  - CheckoutPageView()
  - ConfirmationPageView()
Additional functions
  - Cart (open and close) !important
  - Header
  - Footer
  - NAV-bar



